    "longBusinessSummary": "Kingboard Laminates Holdings Limited, an investment holding company, engages in the manufacture and sale of laminates in the People's Republic of China, Europe, other Asian countries, and the United States. It operates through Laminates, Properties, and Investments segments. The company offers glass epoxy and paper laminates. It also provides upstream component materials, such as copper foils, glass yarns, glass fabrics, bleached kraft papers, epoxy resins, kraft papers for copper-clad laminates, and PVB. In addition, it sells and rents properties; trades in copper; and provides hotel accommodation services. Further, the company manufactures and distributes chemicals; electronic special materials; and specialty resins. Its investment property portfolio comprises commercial, residential, and industrial properties. The company was founded in 1988 and is headquartered in Sha Tin, Hong Kong. Kingboard Laminates Holdings Limited operates as a subsidiary of Jamplan (BVI) Limited.", // 公司业务摘要
