        "contentType": "STORY",
        "title": "Kingboard Laminates Holdings (SEHK:1888) Slides Sharply, Is The Valuation Still Too Rich?", // 职位
        "description": "",
        "summary": "Why Kingboard Laminates Holdings Is Back on Investor Radars Kingboard Laminates Holdings (SEHK:1888) has caught investor attention after recent share price swings, including a single day decline of 4.6% and a fall of 32.7% over the past week. These short term moves contrast with gains over the past month and past 3 months. This is prompting closer scrutiny of how the company’s laminate focused business and broader revenue profile align with different holding periods. See our latest analysis...",
